Skyrim Script Extender (SKSE) 1.7.3
Copyright (c) Ian Patterson and Stephen Abel.

The LE SDK target uses selected official SKSE 1.7.3 headers and support sources. At configure time it fetches the official archive from https://skse.silverlock.org/beta/skse_1_07_03.7z and verifies SHA-256 1825024212A20A6A197BBCD308073B497E516139AD48D60685D5B18AB4BBE76D. No SKSE archive or source tree is included in the install package. The source terms recorded in licenses/SKSE-source-terms.txt prohibit rehosting SKSE files; direct users to https://skse.silverlock.org/ for SKSE itself.

See licenses/SKSE-source-terms.txt and cmake/SKSE-PATCHES.md for source terms, provenance, the selected source subset, and private build-only compatibility patches.
